<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Oakfields in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Oakfields in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oakfields Thoroughbreds and Leisure Industries Ltd announced on Tuesday that talks were in progress which, if successfully concluded, could affect the company's share price.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution in their sharedealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
